    "eb37db64-1181-4585-8663-718148ca1d8a": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17736425308440__eb37db64-1181-4585-8663-718148ca1d8a-1675696967f9fe1e2d-0": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Best Healing Olive Oil",
            "text": "<p>I’ve been using this product for about a month now and I feel less bloated, more energy, and I even feel smaller around my waist line. Love this product. Recommend it 100%<br\/><br\/>- Patricia<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17736425308440__eb37db64-1181-4585-8663-718148ca1d8a-1675696967f9fe1e2d-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cooking With Zimms Organics Oils",
            "text": "<p>I have now cooked several dishes with the olive oil and it is excellent. It is very smooth, blends easily into the dish being prepared, and does not distort the taste of the food, as some other olive oils do. Also purchased the gold colored spout, which makes pouring and storing handy. All the items are well worth their price.<br\/><br\/>- Steven<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17736425308440__eb37db64-1181-4585-8663-718148ca1d8a-1675696967f9fe1e2d-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Helping Me Heal",
            "text": "<p>I have struggled with chronic IBS-C and other debilitating digestive issues (vomiting, gas, burning\/scratching in abdomen, etc). After trying every laxative, home therapy, and emergency room tactic under the sun, this stuff is a miracle. However, since I began using this product a couple of months ago, my constipation and the accompanying symptoms have abated significantly. I surge with gratitude. Even though the company has a separate oil for cooking, I use this to cook and it does the medical and culinary jobs most wonderfully :)<\/p><p>- Courtney S.<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--17736425308440__eb37db64-1181-4585-8663-718148ca1d8a-1675696967f9fe1e2d-0",
